<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .email-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #1a73e8;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      .button-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .button {
        background-color: #1a73e8 !important;
        color: white !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 18px;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        display: inline-block;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        font-weight: bold;
        border: none;
        text-align: center;
        width: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
      }
      .button:hover {
        background-color: #1558b2 !important;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888;
      }
      .bold {
        font-weight: bold;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        Welcome to Virtual Job Fair
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p class="bold">Hello Career Officer,</p>
        <p>A new recruiter has registered on the <strong>Virtual Job Fair Platform</strong> and requires your approval to proceed. Below are the details provided by the recruiter:</p>
        
        <!-- Recruiter Full Name -->
        <p><strong>Full Name:</strong> <%= @recruiter.full_name %></p>
        
        <!-- Recruiter Email -->
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @recruiter.email %></p>
        
        <!-- Recruiter Company Name -->
        <p><strong>Company Name:</strong> <%= @recruiter.recruiter_profile.company_name %></p>

        <p>To approve this recruiter and allow them access to the platform, please click the button below:</p>

        <div class="button-container">
          <a href="<%= confirm_recruiter_url(approval_token: @recruiter.generate_approval_token) %>" class="button">
            Approve Recruiter
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>If the information provided seems <strong>unprofessional</strong>, <strong>ambiguous</strong>, or if you have any doubts about the legitimacy of this request, please <strong>ignore this email</strong> or contact the company directly for confirmation.</p>

        <p>Thank you for helping us maintain the integrity of the <strong>Virtual Job Fair Platform</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2025 Virtual Job Fair Platform. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>